  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroSequence
  lines:
  - Detroit, MI, 1984
  - Huh, what's this? Someone lost their Super5 ticket.
  - It's for tonight's drawing. 3, 7, 10, 15, 42... Those are all lucky numbers.
  - "Maybe I can sell it.  Landlord wants his rent by tomorrow. There's no way I'll
    be able to pay up. There's just\u2014"
  - Wait...do I feel lucky? What have I got to lose?
  text: {fileID: 1142202310}
  group: {fileID: 1142202309}
  fadeTime: 4
  holdTime: 2.5
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
